 (4594,4640,'NATIVE IDENTITY ROUTING',evidence('CAMPAIGN3_IDENTITY_PUBLIC_QUALIFICATION.md','IDENTITY_PUBLIC_FINDINGS.md','CAMPAIGN3_PUBLIC_WRAPPER_QUIESCENCE_QUALIFICATION.md'),'Repeated closure index is an additional original occurrence,not extra runtime coverage. Separate Task/Biological actor channels do not establish shared cross-context trait direction. NoFeedback comparison and whole-safe-view tests establish specified lineage/epistemic scope; original serial Save132 success did not establish scheduler-to-ledger quiescence,subsequently corrected by dedicated wrapper qualification. Biological acquired state may be absent,neutral,below threshold or change a distribution without sampled divergence. Whole-history Refold is not a lossy reduction. Represented self-concept,natural recognition,enacted coercion and adaptation remain later gates.'),
 (4641,4671,'IDENTITY BELIEF COMPONENT',evidence('CAMPAIGN3_IDENTITY_BELIEF_QUALIFICATION.md','IDENTITY_BELIEF_FINDINGS.md','CAMPAIGN3_IDENTITY_BELIEF_PUBLIC_QUALIFICATION.md'),'Five models37 runs222 component prefixes represent holder-specific admitted polarity history,estimate and goal-relative prospective appraisal separately from source standing. Prior seed1 A/A/A/B was already qualified,not newly seed-searched; Mean+1 to+1/2 preserves direction while Latest becomes-1 and both retain contrary act.7/8 final differences retain seed6 equality. Withheld self evidence leaves standing present but belief unknown; known0 gives adverse1/2,not absence. Opposing histories may share mean0 without identical evidence. PrivateOracle/StandingAlias are failed reduction controls,not lawful mechanisms. Later correct reports revise current estimate while preserving earlier false observations/judgments. NoLearning retains available observations without accepted update. Goal-only intervention changes appraisal,not belief; no extra standing bonus or new social action. Equal weights/polarity and sample counts do not provide calibrated confidence. Native later admission requires explicit prior140 appraisal lag.'),
